ex": "b0P", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "checkpoint_inference.py\nLoad the checkpoint BEFORE preparing pixels.\nNo flags? Use its saved size, here (5, 3).\nMatching flags are accepted.\nConflicting (3, 5) flags fail; do not override.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "checkpoint_inference.py\nLoad the checkpoint BEFORE preparing pixels.\nNo flags? Use its saved size, here (5, 3).\nMatching flags are accepted.\nConflicting (3, 5) flags fail; do not override.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "checkpoint_inference.py\nLoad the checkpoint BEFORE preparing pixels.\nNo flags? Use its saved size, here (5, 3).\nMatching flags are accepted.\nConflicting (3, 5) flags fail; do not override."}, {"id": "m49-026", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1065, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490026, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490126, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Q", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract"}, {"id": "m49-027", "type": "rectangle", "x": 840, "y": 855, "width": 610, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490027, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490127, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0R", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-028", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 873, "width": 566, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490028, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 490128, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0S", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "load_torch_checkpoint_bundle()", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "load_torch_checkpoint_bundle()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "load_torch_checkpoint_bundle()"}, {"id": "m49-029", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 915, "width": 566, "height": 125.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490129, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0T", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "model.py\nRead the file once and validate the recipe.\nMissing legacy metadata? Ask to regenerate.\nUnsupported recipe? Reject it clearly.\nNone is an explicit no-resize, not missing data.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "model.py\nRead the file once and validate the recipe.\nMissing legacy metadata? Ask to regenerate.\nUnsupported recipe? Reject it clearly.\nNone is an explicit no-resize, not missing data.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "model.py\nRead the file once and validate the recipe.\nMissing legacy metadata? Ask to regenerate.\nUnsupported recipe? Reject it clearly.\nNone is an explicit no-resize, not missing data."}, {"id": "m49-030", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1065, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490130, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0U", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract"}, {"id": "m49-031", "type": "arrow", "x": 395, "y": 1105, "width": 0, "height": 65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490131, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0V", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 65]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-032", "type": "text", "x": 419, "y": 1117, "width": 560, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490132, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0W", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "the validated recipe decides how pixels are read", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "the validated recipe decides how pixels are read", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "the validated recipe decides how pixels are read"}, {"id": "m49-033", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 1175, "width": 610, "height": 265, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490133, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0X", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-034", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1193, "width": 566, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490034, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490134, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Y", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "4. load_sample_for_prediction()", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4. load_sample_for_prediction()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "4. load_sample_for_prediction()"}, {"id": "m49-035", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1235, "width": 566, "height": 125.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490035, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490135, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Z", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "checkpoint_inference.py -> existing image loader\nRGBA 13x9 -> RGB 5x3 = 15 pixels\n15 * 3 channels = 45 numbers\nNormalize: e.g. 128 / 255 = 0.502\nHWC (3,5,3) -> NCHW (1,3,3,5)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "checkpoint_inference.py -> existing image loader\nRGBA 13x9 -> RGB 5x3 = 15 pixels\n15 * 3 channels = 45 numbers\nNormalize: e.g. 128 / 255 = 0.502\nHWC (3,5,3) -> NCHW (1,3,3,5)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "checkpoint_inference.py -> existing image loader\nRGBA 13x9 -> RGB 5x3 = 15 pixels\n15 * 3 channels = 45 numbers\nNormalize: e.g. 128 / 255 = 0.502\nHWC (3,5,3) -> NCHW (1,3,3,5)"}, {"id": "m49-036", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1405, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490036, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490136, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0a", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Normalized Model-Ready Numbers", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Normalized Model-Ready Numbers", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Normalized Model-Ready Numbers"}, {"id": "m49-037", "type": "rectangle", "x": 840, "y": 1175, "width": 610, "height": 265, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490137, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0b", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-038", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1193, "width": 566, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490038, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490138, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0c", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Why identical preparation matters", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Why identical preparation matters", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Why identical preparation matters"}, {"id": "m49-039", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1235, "width": 566, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0d", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Resizing changes neighborhoods and pixels.\nThe same weights can give different scores\nif the API forgets the training resize.\n\nTests compare ALL prepared channel values,\nnot just the winning class label.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Resizing changes neighborhoods and pixels.\nThe same weights can give different scores\nif the API forgets the training resize.\n\nTests compare ALL prepared channel values,\nnot just the winning class label.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Resizing changes neighborhoods and pixels.\nThe same weights can give different scores\nif the API forgets the training resize.\n\nTests compare ALL prepared channel values,\nnot just the winning class label."}, {"id": "m49-040", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1405, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490140, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0e", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Checkpoint Preprocessing Contract"}, {"id": "m49-041", "type": "arrow", "x": 395, "y": 1445, "width": 0, "height": 65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0f", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 65]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-042", "type": "text", "x": 419, "y": 1457, "width": 560, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490142, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0g", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "use learned weights; no backward or optimizer step", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "use learned weights; no backward or optimizer step", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "use learned weights; no backward or optimizer step"}, {"id": "m49-043", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 1515, "width": 610, "height": 275, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490143, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0h", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-044", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1533, "width": 566, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490044, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 490144, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0i", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "5. run_torch_forward_pass()", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. run_torch_forward_pass()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "5. run_torch_forward_pass()"}, {"id": "m49-045", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1575, "width": 566, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490145, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0j", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "model.py\nOne image -> 4 logits -> softmax probabilities\nObserved after two epochs on the test PNG:\nlogits: [0.0914, 0.2902, -0.4286, -0.2973]\nprobabilities: [0.2863, 0.3493, 0.1702, 0.1941]\nSynthetic numbers, not useful galaxy accuracy.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "model.py\nOne image -> 4 logits -> softmax probabilities\nObserved after two epochs on the test PNG:\nlogits: [0.0914, 0.2902, -0.4286, -0.2973]\nprobabilities: [0.2863, 0.3493, 0.1702, 0.1941]\nSynthetic numbers, not useful galaxy accuracy.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "model.py\nOne image -> 4 logits -> softmax probabilities\nObserved after two epochs on the test PNG:\nlogits: [0.0914, 0.2902, -0.4286, -0.2973]\nprobabilities: [0.2863, 0.3493, 0.1702, 0.1941]\nSynthetic numbers, not useful galaxy accuracy."}, {"id": "m49-046", "type": "text", "x": 112, "y": 1755, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490046, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490146, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0k", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Logits, Probabilities, And Loss", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Logits, Probabilities, And Loss", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Logits, Probabilities, And Loss"}, {"id": "m49-047", "type": "rectangle", "x": 840, "y": 1515, "width": 610, "height": 275, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490147, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0l", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-048", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1533, "width": 566, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490048, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490148, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0m", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "6. classify_with_optional_checkpoint()", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "6. classify_with_optional_checkpoint()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "6. classify_with_optional_checkpoint()"}, {"id": "m49-049", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1575, "width": 566, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490149, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0n", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "galaxy-classifier-service/main.py\nSame image + checkpoint -> same prediction\nHTTP 200: spiral, confidence 0.3493151\n\nInvalid checkpoint recipe -> HTTP 503\nNo checkpoint config -> original stub, no torch.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "galaxy-classifier-service/main.py\nSame image + checkpoint -> same prediction\nHTTP 200: spiral, confidence 0.3493151\n\nInvalid checkpoint recipe -> HTTP 503\nNo checkpoint config -> original stub, no torch.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "galaxy-classifier-service/main.py\nSame image + checkpoint -> same prediction\nHTTP 200: spiral, confidence 0.3493151\n\nInvalid checkpoint recipe -> HTTP 503\nNo checkpoint config -> original stub, no torch."}, {"id": "m49-050", "type": "text", "x": 862, "y": 1755, "width": 566, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490050, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490150, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0o", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Optional Service Checkpoint Inference", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Optional Service Checkpoint Inference", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Optional Service Checkpoint Inference"}, {"id": "m49-051", "type": "arrow", "x": 705, "y": 1650, "width": 125, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 490051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0p", "points": [[0, 0], [125, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m49-052", "type": "text", "x": 729, "y": 1662, "width": 560, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": nul